    LABELS

A label describes a form control.

<label>Name</label>
<input type="text">

But there's a better way.
Connect the label to the input using for and id.

<label for="name">Name:</label>
<input type="text" id="name">

The relationship is
label for="name"
        ↓
input id="name"

⭐ for should match the input's id.
This is extremely important for accessibility and usability.

